    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SQUASER 4\u00a0\u00a0</strong>is a unique minimalist puzzle game where your mission is to wipe away all traces of darkness. Control a white square in a world of black, white, and gray tones, clearing your path through dark labyrinths. Each level brings new challenges, demanding greater logic, memory, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this world of stark contrasts, planning each move carefully as you erase every bit of darkness to leave each level pristine. Progress from a beginner to a true <i>erasure expert</i>, achieving perfection on every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse and the keyboard (WASD or arrow keys) to navigate through the different mazes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SQUASER 4</strong>:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f 50 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Minimalist art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Simple controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Calm, relaxing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0f Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498640/extras/54448b0ae048506de5de875208341701.poster.avif?t=1745461228\" width=60 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498640/extras/54448b0ae048506de5de875208341701.webm?t=1745461228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498640/extras/ec898f5c64d7aab58eb337c3d0df21e5.poster.avif?t=1745461228\" width=60 height=60 ><source src=\"https://sh